<title>UK: LIFFE cocoa inches higher, coffee quietly up AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE cocoa inches higher, coffee quietly up AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COCOA - Gaps higher as expected and holds early gains in slow trade. Sept up four stg at 1,127 stg at 0921 GMT.</p>
<p>COFFEE - Thinly traded. Sept, one of the two traded months, up $37 at $1,815 on a paltry volume of 101 lots.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Volume minimal. Only Aug traded, down 10 cents at $323.50.</p>
</text>
